  ('national-gallery', 'National Gallery Singapore', 'Civic District', 1.2903, 103.8515, array['museum', 'art', 'architecture']::text[], 90, 2, true, 'City Hall', '[["10:00","19:00"]]'::jsonb, '{}'::int[], null, 'Southeast Asian art in the former Supreme Court and City Hall; rooftop garden overlooks the Padang.', array['The rooftop is free and has one of the best Padang views.', 'Old courtroom holding cells are open to walk through.', 'Rain plan: you can spend two hours here easily.']::text[], null, 'https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b3/Interior_of_the_National_Gallery_Singapore.jpg/960px-Interior_of_the_National_Gallery_Singapore.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail', 'Wikipedia: National Gallery Singapore'),
